{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《紐約時報》報道，OpenAI CEO薩姆·奧特曼(Sam Altman)周三表示，<strong>推動AI安全發展本身就存在取捨，公司必須在優先保障安全與繼續推進AI技術發展之間取得平衡</strong>。「我們不可能讓所有人都滿意。」奧特曼在DealBook峯會上表示。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587046.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.862375+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:14:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_hash":"1c2705a2f3bd14ce5c69d096e7c612e80110a90090a9f6e09390f8856e03b2bc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}